# The voices' entry on Steam's DOS copy (fixtures/sound: English texts
# and voices on the Sound Blaster), the port started in its folder,
# which holds the English voices alone. Right steps the voices from
# English straight to None, past French and German, and Right again to
# English, its test voice spoken. Left steps back to None, and Left
# again straight to English.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Down Return
sleep 3
key Down Down Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot page
key Down Down Right
sleep 3
shot none
key Right
sleep 6
shot english
key Left
sleep 3
shot noneback
key Left
sleep 6
shot englishback
key Up Up Return
sleep 3
shot options
